quran[13]{c,v,t}:
  36,71,"Do they not see that We have created livestock for them, among (all other things) that Our Mighty Hands have generated, and they have control over them?"
  36,72,And We subjected these (animals) to them. So some of them are used for riding and some for food.
  36,73,"And in these (animals), there are other advantages and drinks (derived from them). Will they not then give thanks?"
  36,74,"Still, they have taken (idols as) gods besides Allah, hoping they might be helped."
  36,75,"But they cannot help them, and those (idolaters) will be an army for these (idols), presented (together in Hell)."
  36,76,So do not let their words grieve you. We indeed know what they conceal and what they reveal.
  36,77,"Does human being not see that We created him from a fertilised egg (i.e. zygote*)? And even then, he is an open disputant?"
  36,78,And he draws comparisons for Us and forgets (the truth of) his creation. He says: ‘Who will revive the bones when they have (already) decayed?’
  36,79,Say: ‘He will revive them Who brought them into existence in the first instance. And He is All-Knowing of every created being.
  36,80,(He is) the One Who produces fire for you out of the green tree. And behold! You kindle light from it.
  36,81,"Is He Who created the heavens and the earth not able to produce the likes of them (again)?’ Of course (He can)! For He is the Supreme Creator, the All-Knowing."
  36,82,"His command, when He wills something, is to only say to it: ‘Be!’ So it is."
  36,83,"So, Glory be to Him in Whose Hand lies the dominion of all things, and to Whom you shall be returned."
